Banana Bread (Dana's typed copy of Nana's recipe, February 2026)

Ingredients: 3 ripe bananas, 1/3 cup butter, 3/4 cup sugar, 1 egg, 1 teaspoon baking soda, salt, 1 1/2 cups flour.

Bake at 325 degrees for 70 minutes, until a toothpick comes out clean.

Note: add a handful of chocolate chips for Milo.
